This covers questions/ (questions written for this game), tools/opentdb/ and
tools/opentriviaqa/ (data derived from the sources below, including difficulty and
correctness ratings), and the question bank tools/build_questions.py builds from them.

Sources, both CC BY-SA 4.0:
* Open Trivia Database, https://opentdb.com
* OpenTriviaQA, https://github.com/uberspot/OpenTriviaQA

If you share these questions or anything made from them, credit those sources and
share it under the same license.
